        operation='Collect existing mainline story-version selection, map battle options/checkpoint/player-loadout extraction, Map12 private invitation and shared daily-dungeon core dependencies. Retain prior official payload and GUID identities. Unity expanded previously minimal texture/text importer metadata and serialized Map13 pipeline prefilter fields; these generated defaults are not a claim of complete original Sprite binding. No new art payload or full asset snapshot.',
